d 'DAGAMESOLVE': module to solve sequences of simultaneous-move, discrete-action, complete-information games.
d
d dagamesolve solves discrete-action, simultaneous-move, complete-information games
d with payoffs specified in list form. It supports N-player games and sequences of
d games solved in a single call, and computes pure and mixed-strategy Nash equilibria.
d
d KW: game theory, Nash equilibrium
d 
d Requires: Stata version 12
d
d Distribution-Date: 20230601
d
d Author: M. J. Baker, Hunter College and the Graduate Center, City University of New York
d
F dagamesolve.ado
F dagamestrats.ado
F dagamesolve.sthlp
F dagamestrats.sthlp
F ldagamesolve.mlib

